    "fileId": 18177,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Osteosarcoma Circos plot",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "The plot shows many interchromosomal translocations (curved purple Inter-chr lines), intrachromosomal translocations (green Intra-chr lines), and copy-number alterations (gains in red, losses in blue, and loss of heterozygosity [LOH] in orange). The positions of selected SNV-containing genes are indicated (genes with silent mutations shown in green; insertions or deletions [indels] in red; nonsense or missense mutations in brown).",
    "source": "Plot was modified from Chen et al. Cell Reports 7, 104-112 {24703847}. Is permission required from the journal?",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
    "imageUrl": "https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/static/dzi/44/215/18177.jpg",
    "thumbnail": "https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/static/dzi/44/215/thumb_18177.jpg"
